        "id": 142588,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-17T06:25:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thoughts/Opinions on the mind control in the Avengers? &nbsp;(the first one. &nbsp;I haven't seen the second yet, so I don't know if there's any mind control in that one)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think that one didn't press people's buttons because the only characters it really affected were Hawkeye and Selvig who were at best minor players, and so having their autonomy taken away was easier to not take so personally.&nbsp;Now, if Black Widow had been the one that had to be saved by Hawkeye, yeah, that probably wouldn't have gone over well.</p>",
