        "created_at": "2015-06-17T19:41:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have to admit that the last time I used it when writing it was under a strict few conditions, first it was pure power incontinence, the character who did it had no intentions of doing it and was horrified when she found out she'd done it, second it ended as soon as she was too far away (to prevent the entire hoard of love zombies thing) and finally, it had severe and recurring consequences including almost breaking the masquerade.</p>",
