        "created_at": "2015-06-19T15:31:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Blossercubbles\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/48/1863_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blossercubbles:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was hoping someone would mention this. Mind Control is about as squicky as it comes, but so well done with that.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Squick up to eleven though. Really well done, but also&nbsp;<em>horrifying.</em></p>",
