        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-19T22:48:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, squick doesn't even begin to describe some of the things that happen in Worm.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've said once or twice that Worm is what you'd get if George R. R. Martin wrote a superhero story. &nbsp;(And yes, I'm aware that we was one of the creative minds behind the Wild Card universe. &nbsp;Which I haven't read enough of to know whether it's darker than Worm is, although (for the sake of my mind) I really hope it isn't.)</p>",
